{"id":"41d9670193aa08f6","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-predicate-varieties.md","title":"真理谓词的句法与语义变体","display":"df-truth-predicate-varieties — 真理谓词的句法与语义变体","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-predicate-varieties","aliases":["91-df-truth-predicate-varieties","91-df-T-varieties","91-df-truth-types"],"display":"df-truth-predicate-varieties — 真理谓词的句法与语义变体","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-truth-predicate-typed]]","[[91-df-untyped-truth]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-predicate-varieties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-predicate-varieties</span><span>91-df-T-varieties</span><span>91-df-truth-types</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-predicate-varieties — 真理谓词的句法与语义变体"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"297207ea3fca7fff\" href=\"?note=297207ea3fca7fff\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate-typed\">91-df-truth-predicate-typed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52e708105e8ce779\" href=\"?note=52e708105e8ce779\" title=\"91-df-untyped-truth\">91-df-untyped-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-predicate-varieties-—-真理谓词的句法与语义变体-$\\mathrm{TPVar}$\">df-truth-predicate-varieties — 真理谓词的句法与语义变体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TPVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{TPVar}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (基础语言及其真理扩张)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\\)</span> (一元真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dom}_{\\mathrm{sch}}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Dom}_{\\mathrm{sch}}(T)\\)</span> (T-双条件模式的许可实例域)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (对所用后继指标封闭的线性序指标集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\mathcal L_\\alpha,T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I}\">\\(\\langle\\mathcal L_\\alpha,T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I}\\)</span> (分层语言与谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (带部分真值评估 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M}\\)</span> 的模型)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}varieties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SchemaTyped}(T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_T)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Dom}_{\\mathrm{sch}}(T)\n=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TypeFree}(T;\\mathcal L_T)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\nT\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hierarchical}(\\langle\\mathcal L_\\alpha,T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I})\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\,\n\\bigl(\nT_\\alpha\\in\n\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}}^{1}\n\\setminus\n\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_{\\alpha}}^{1}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Dom}_{\\mathrm{sch}}(T_\\alpha)\n=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Partial}(\\mathcal M)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}varieties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SchemaTyped}(T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_T)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Dom}_{\\mathrm{sch}}(T)\n=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TypeFree}(T;\\mathcal L_T)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\nT\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hierarchical}(\\langle\\mathcal L_\\alpha,T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I})\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\,\n\\bigl(\nT_\\alpha\\in\n\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}}^{1}\n\\setminus\n\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_{\\alpha}}^{1}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Dom}_{\\mathrm{sch}}(T_\\alpha)\n=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Partial}(\\mathcal M)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这四项不在同一个分类维度。模式类型化限制双条件的实例域；型自由性\n说明同一个谓词可以句法上应用于含自身的句子；层级性使用多个逐层新增的\n谓词；部分性则是某个模型中存在未定值的语义性质。</p>\n<p>UTB 很好地展示了区别：它在单一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 中使用同一个谓词，\n但统一双条件的矩阵仍限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span>。所以“句法型自由”不蕴含\n“全语言透明”，更不蕴含非保守。</p>\n<p>KF 是型自由理论，强 Kleene 固定点可给出部分真值模型；VF 的标准意向\n语义是超赋值而不是强 Kleene，不过其超真外延也可能不给每个句子或其\n否定赋真。部分性必须相对于指定语义陈述，不能由经典对象式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 单独读成“未定义”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-predicate-varieties-—-真理谓词的句法与语义变体-$\\mathrm{TPVar}$","text":"df-truth-predicate-varieties — 真理谓词的句法与语义变体 $\\mathrm{TPVar}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate-typed","status":"resolved","id":"297207ea3fca7fff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate-typed]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-untyped-truth","status":"resolved","id":"52e708105e8ce779","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-untyped-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TPVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dom}_{\\mathrm{sch}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\mathcal L_\\alpha,T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}varieties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SchemaTyped}(T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_T)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Dom}_{\\mathrm{sch}}(T)\n=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TypeFree}(T;\\mathcal L_T)\n&\\coloneqq\nT\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hierarchical}(\\langle\\mathcal L_\\alpha,T_\\alpha\\rangle_{\\alpha\\in I})\n&\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\,\n\\bigl(\nT_\\alpha\\in\n\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}}^{1}\n\\setminus\n\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_{\\alpha}}^{1}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Dom}_{\\mathrm{sch}}(T_\\alpha)\n=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Partial}(\\mathcal M)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":2756,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate-varieties]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-d